a3+b3-c3+3abc = (a + b – c)(a2 + b2 + c2 – ab + bc + ca)

Now we will convert this into a valid Java expression.

Let x= a3+b3-c3+3abc

=  (a + b – c)(a2 + b2 + c2 – ab + bc + ca)

= (a+b-c)*( (a * a) + (b * b) +(c*c)- (a * b)+(b * c)+( c * a))

